DixScript uses a two-tier system (inspired by TOML):

TIER 1 (Flat Properties): property = value
TIER 2 (Grouped Data):    table.path: ... OR array.path:: ...

Correct order:
@DATA(
flat1 = "value",     // Tier 1 first
flat2 = 42,
table.prop: x = 1   // Tier 2 follows
array:: item1, item2
)

